Description:It is your first main phase. You control Memnite (summoning sick) and have Torch the Tower (2 damage to target creature or planeswalker; bargain: 3 damage instead; a permanent it damaged that would die is exiled instead) in hand with one red mana floating. The opponent is at 20 life and controls Hill Giant (3/3). Get rid of the Hill Giant this turn.
